1
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,800
大家安安 怎么样啊
Hey, all y'all. What's going down?

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,140
我对你的意见
My opinion of you.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,460
就是戴个假眼镜是闹哪样
What's with the fake glasses?

4
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,340
对戴真眼镜的人来说 你这样太无礼了
As an actual glasses wearer, this is offensive.

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:13,580
就好像没残疾的人把车停在残疾人专用车位
It's like non-disabled people who park in handicapped spaces.

6
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:16,060
我进去出来就借停了三分钟 小姑娘
I was in and out in three minutes, young lady,

7
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,240
而且我是去拿你的针眼药
and it was your stye medication I was picking up.

8
00:00:18,422 --> 00:00:20,680
手链有点多啊 小子
That's a lot of bracelets there, buddy.

9
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,580
不用管她们 是她们太胆小了
Just ignore them. They're being sheep.

10
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,700
如果我以前也老是在意别人说的话
If I'd listened to what other people said,

11
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,740
90年代我根本不可能弄那个酷炫的发型
I'd never have rocked my '90s frosted tips.

12
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,700
我们还有照片
We've got pictures.

13
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,820
才没有呢
No, we don't.

14
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,360
你是独一无二的 儿子
You're an original, son.

15
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,060
上天创造你的时候 没用模具做
When they made you, they broke the mold.

16
00:00:34,401 --> 00:00:35,281
好吗 卢邓
What's good, L.D.?

17
00:00:35,281 --> 00:00:36,376
当然
Yo, will.

18
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,740
卢克 这样问可能不太好
Luke, um, there's no easy way to ask this.

19
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,140
你是加入什么男团了吗
Are you in a boy band?

20
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,780
我们要去码头耍
So, we're gonna go hang at the pier.

21
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,360
你去吗
You in?

22
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:46,620
好像不错 但我可能去不了
Sounds cool, but I don't know if I can.

23
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,080
没错 我们今天有很多事情
That's right. We got a big day planned.

24
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,380
他要来给他老爹打工
He's coming to work with the old man.

25
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:50,900
抱歉
Sorry.

26
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:51,800
下次吧
Next time.

27
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:52,760
债贱[再见]
Deuces.

28
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:53,800
债贱
Deuces.

29
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,440
同意[跟你们的妈妈说吧]
Word to your mothers.

30
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,920
说真的 大卫 替我跟你妈打个招呼
Seriously, David. Tell your mom I say hi.

31
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,820
她来啦 我们的小天才
There she is -- our little genius.

32
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,840
看看我认真的小姑娘
Look at my conscientious little girl

33
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,860
提早一天就开始准备去上大学
getting ready to leave for college a whole day early.

34
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,080
我今天就走
I'm leaving today.

35
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,400
-什么 -不要啊
- What? - No.

36
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,620
不不不 不行 我们都计划好了
No, no. No, no. We have a plan.

37
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:11,140
我打算晚餐给你做你最爱的菜
I-I was gonna make your favorite meal for dinner,

38
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:13,640
然后我们因为分离焦虑会吵架
and then we were gonna fight because of separation anxiety,

39
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,700
然后明天早上
and then tomorrow morning,

40
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,560
我们会在你离家之前又和好
we would make up before you leave for good.

41
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,450
-我就... -不行不行
- I just -- -Oh! No, no,

42
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:19,440
各位 所以我才没有告诉你们
guys, this is exactly why I didn't tell you!

43
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,440
但我不能送你去学校啊 我今天有房子开放日
But I can't take you. I have a showing.

44
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,220
我准备要刻离别歌曲盘在送你的路上放呢
I was gonna burn a CD of goodbye songs for the ride.

45
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,320
我对我的决定感到前所未有的满意
I have never felt better about a decision.

46
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:28,160
我学校离家里就30分钟车程
Look, I'm only 30 minutes away,

47
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,500
而且我过几个星期就回来了
And I'll be back in a couple of weeks.

48
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:31,600
我已经让海莉送我过去了
I already asked Haley to take me.

49
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:33,580
我该走了
Well, I better get going.

50
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,960
你们每个人可以抱我5秒钟
You may each hug me for five seconds.

51
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:38,660
我想告诉你 你永远是我的小姑娘
I want you to know that you'll always be my little girl.

52
00:01:40,163 --> 00:01:41,820
再见...
Goodbye, nor--

53
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:42,960
时间到了 老妈
Time's up. Mom.

54
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,880
我好为你骄傲
I am so proud of you,

55
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,820
我知道你会取得伟大的成就
and I know you're gonna achieve great things in this world,

56
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,900
我最近读到有一种新甲油
and I just read about this new nail polish that changes colors

57
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,480
如果你把指甲放进有迷药的饮料 就会变色
if you dip it in a drink that has a roofie --

58
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,240
-下一位 -我不用了
- Next. -I'm good.

59
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:53,380
那好吧 很好
All right, cool.

60
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:55,460
我到了会给你们发短信的
Well, I will text you guys when I get there.

61
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,320
他的5秒钟给我
I'm taking his five seconds.

62
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:14,180
彻底悲剧 没别的形容方式了
It's a tragedy -- no other way to put it.

63
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,780
本来多美好的一天
Such a beautiful day, too.

64
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:18,420
只要学着接受莉莉有足球比赛
We just have to accept that Lily has a soccer game

65
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:19,900
我们都得去观赛就可以了
and we all have to be there.

66
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:22,060
你早该找个借口的
You were supposed to make an excuse.

67
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:22,780
我很抱歉
I'm sorry!

68
00:02:23,292 --> 00:02:25,000
我在集市上碰到小卡
I ran into Cam at the market.

69
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,680
他问我们能不能去 我就慌了
He asked if we could go. I panicked.

70
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,180
我自作自受[朝自己脚开一枪]
I shot myself in the foot.

71
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:30,060
是啊 你朝你的脚上开了一枪
Oh, yeah, you shot yourself on your foot,

72
00:02:30,060 --> 00:02:31,520
你把脚放进自己嘴里[说错话]
You put your foot in your mouth,

73
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:33,720
你鞋子穿错脚了
you put the shoe in the wrong foot.

74
00:02:33,821 --> 00:02:36,313
你们美国人为啥什么都要扯到脚啊
What is with you Americans and the foot?

75
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,380
顺便说一嘴 我讨厌那幅画
I hate that painting, by the way.

76
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:42,020
我要去把最后一个可颂甜甜圈吃掉 我太难过了
I'm having the last cronut. I'm so depressed.

77
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:44,280
抱歉 孩子 安迪已经给吃掉了
I'm sorry, kid. I think Andy ate it.

78
00:02:44,719 --> 00:02:46,077
比赛2点开始是吗
So the game starts at 2:00, right?

79
00:02:46,077 --> 00:02:47,720
是杰吃掉了最后一个可颂甜甜圈
Jay ate the last cronut.

80
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,900
没人喜欢告密者哦 小孩
No one likes a tattletale, kid.

81
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,520
谢谢你这么诚实 宝贝
Thank you, baby, for being so honest.

82
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,900
所以我们一小时后出发
So we should leave in about an hour.

83
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:54,980
什么"我们"
What is this "we"?

84
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,740
我得去给乔注册冬令营
I have to go and register Joe for the winter camp.

85
00:02:58,985 --> 00:03:01,395
妈咪要去买鞋子
Mommy's going to buy shoes.

86
00:03:01,395 --> 00:03:03,280
我可没养一个叛徒
I did not raise a rat!

87
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,280
没人逃得过
Nobody gets out of this.

88
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:07,340
世界上最糟糕的运动 世界上最糟糕的运动员
World's worst sport, world's worst players of it.

89
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,960
22个小女孩挤成一团
22 girls in a cluster

90
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,280
像个坏掉的吸尘器一样之字形穿过球场
Zig-zagging across a field like a busted roomba.

91
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:14,480
唯一吸得起来的就是我宝贵的两小时
Except the only thing it sucks up is two hours of my life.

92
00:03:16,060 --> 00:03:17,480
看吧 这座卖不出去的房子
Behold, the unsellable house.

93
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,480
挂牌2年了
Two years on the market,

94
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:22,100
已经击溃了城里所有房地产代理人的心
It's crushed the soul of every real-estate agent in town.

95
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:25,800
陶德与泰瑞·泰勒 那对卖房子的夫妇
Todd and Terry Taylor, the spouses selling houses --

96
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,440
现在都离婚了
They're no longer either.

97
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,580
我以前很喜欢跟着我爸爸
I used to love going to work with my dad

98
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,320
去他的杂货店工作 弗兰克食品镇
to his grocery store, Frank's Food Town.

99
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,280
我喜欢看他切断了一根手指
I got to watch him crack up the deli team

100
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,780
把熟食窗口的人逗得捧腹大笑
by pretending to lose a finger,

101
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:38,800
他可以从橘子金字塔里抽出一个来
Or he'd pull out an orange from the pyramid

102
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,200
但金字塔不会倒
and somehow, it wouldn't fall.

103
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:43,000
我才不管外面的招牌说什么
I don't care what the sign out front said --

104
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,800
省钱才不是王道 我爸才是王
Savings wasn't king. My dad was.

105
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,540
艾丽克斯走了
You know, with Alex leaving,

106
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,700
咱俩就有更多时间在一起了
you and I are gonna get to spend a lot more time together.

107
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:49,320
等等
Wait.

108
00:03:50,054 --> 00:03:51,821
这是什么玩意儿
What the whatsit?

109
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,340
这是鸭蛋呢
Those are duck eggs.

110
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:56,680
好酷
Cool. So --

111
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:59,040
还记得咱俩以前老说要养小鸭子吗
Remember how you and I used to talk about raising ducklings

112
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,400
然后给它们建个小鸭戏团
and building them a little bird circus?

113
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:02,026
好像吧
Kind of.

114
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,760
你觉得我们今天要在这里待多久
How long do you think we're gonna be here today?

115
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,940
我喜欢你要说的东西
I like where you're going with this --

116
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:07,100
搞个限时挑战
Make it a time challenge.

117
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:10,000
我觉得我可以在...
I think I can get her done

118
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,560
在五小时之内卖出
in under five hours.

119
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:14,840
那样我们应该有足够的时间去蹦床公园了
That'll leave us time to get to the trampoline park.

120
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,040
对了 惊喜
Oh, and surprise.

121
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:18,140
我们要去蹦床公园了
We're going to the trampoline park.

122
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,240
啵嘤[弹跳声]
Boing!

123
00:04:22,546 --> 00:04:25,135
他这一生将会被...
His life will be rem--

124
00:04:27,222 --> 00:04:28,000
不对
No.

125
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,060
最近家里很忙
So, busy time at the house lately.

126
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:30,760
有趣的忙
Fun busy.

127
00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:31,980
我接了一些工作
I've taken on some work

128
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:33,700
帮人们处理财产和遗嘱
helping people with estates and wills.

129
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,760
比我想象中要更悲伤
It's sadder than I thought it would be.

130
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:36,520
有趣的悲伤
Fun sad.

131
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:39,820
-不不 别开枪 -砰砰砰
- No, no, don't shoot! - Bang, bang, bang, bang!

132
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,260
不
Oh, no!

133
00:04:40,660 --> 00:04:42,200
我要死了 我要死了
I'm dying! I'm dying!

134
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:47,080
同时 我也开始经营一个副业
Meantime, I'm running a side business we started

135
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:50,209
短期出租我们楼上的公寓
doing short-term rentals on our unit upstairs.

136
00:04:50,209 --> 00:04:52,590
我们自称为"艺术房客"
We call ourselves the artful lodgers.

137
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,060
米奇尔 当你填写
Mitchell, by any chance

138
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,700
新的出租协议时
when you were filling out the new rental agreement,

139
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:58,780
你是不是忘了标注不许携带宠物 尤其狗
did you forget to mark no pets, or, specifically, dogs?

140
00:04:59,602 --> 00:05:00,760
真抱歉
Sorry, sorry, ooh!

141
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:01,720
记得唐纳森一家吗
You remember the Donaldsons?

142
00:05:02,514 --> 00:05:04,034
这真是要了命
This is a vanderkoff.

143
00:05:04,667 --> 00:05:06,808
有些夫妇可能会感受到压力
You know, s-some couples might feel the strain

144
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:08,480
互相撒气
and take it out on one another.

145
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,186
但是艺术房客们可不会
But not the artful lodgers.

146
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,560
今早挺艰难的
This morning was tough.

147
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:13,720
好了好了
There, there.

148
00:05:14,060 --> 00:05:16,000
等你准备好了 在这里和这里签字
And whenever you're ready, there and there.

149
00:05:17,278 --> 00:05:18,480
姑娘们 不不不
Girls. No, no, no.

150
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,660
现在时间不合适
Not a good time, not a good time.

151
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:21,580
大爸不是该载你们去比赛吗
Wasn't daddy supposed to be driving you to our game?

152
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,740
大爸在忙着处理着
Daddy's been a little bit busy himself dealing with linens

153
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:25,460
从未被人抱怨过"粗糙"的亚麻织物
that no guest has ever called scratchy before.

154
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:27,000
有办法让房间里暖一点吗
Is there a way to make the room not so cold?

155
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,200
你知道早上在你丈夫身边醒来
Do you know what it's like to wake up

156
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:30,740
而他冷得和冰一样的感觉吗
next to your husband one morning and he's cold as ice?

157
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:31,960
知道
Yes.

158
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,160
你吃早餐的时候我来处理
Yeah, I'll work on that while you eat breakfast.

159
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,020
你做了法国吐司了吗
Did you make the French toast?

160
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:35,940
做了 在桌子上
Yes, it's right on the counter.

161
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,180
-那是法式吐司 -怎么回事
- That's French toast. - What's happening?

162
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,780
我想要法国人吃的普通吐司
I wanted regular toast for the French people.

163
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,500
那你该说清楚啊
Surely there was a better way to describe that.

164
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:41,900
他对蛋过敏 米奇尔
He's allergic to eggs, Mitchell.

165
00:05:43,022 --> 00:05:45,473
你为什么吃啊
Wh-- okay, w-why did you eat that?

166
00:05:45,484 --> 00:05:47,020
他为什么还吃啊
Why -- why did he eat that?

167
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:49,220
也许我们该找另一个时间完成此事
Okay, maybe we should finish this up another time.

168
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,420
告诉你一声
And just so you know

169
00:05:50,670 --> 00:05:52,540
其他人有需要欢迎推荐我
I do -- I do work on referrals.

170
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:00,280
有一间房间你会很喜欢的
Here is a room you're going to love --

171
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:04,100
你的男人基地... 衣橱
Your very own man ca--closet.

172
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:04,720
男人衣橱
Man closet.

173
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,648
谁喜欢地下室啊
Who loves, uh, basements?

174
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,820
我只是问着玩的
That's a rhetorical question.

175
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:09,740
这里有一间地下室
Have I got a basement for you.

176
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,100
下来时注意脚下
Watch your step coming down.

177
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,440
这间地下室已经装修完毕了
Because it's a finished basement,

178
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,280
你们可以看看这里有多大面积
You can actually count the square --

179
00:06:20,727 --> 00:06:23,047
我觉得这栋房子不适合孩子住
I don't think this house is kid-friendly.

180
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,900
我们用攀登绳
Well, you said it yourself

181
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:26,583
爬进车道时 你就这么说了
when we were taking the towrope up the driveway.

182
00:06:26,583 --> 00:06:28,510
这房子看起来像是奇怪的宇宙飞船
This -- this house looks like a weird spaceship.

183
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,460
孩子们都喜欢宇宙飞船
Kids love spaceships.

184
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,320
对吧 卢克
Don't they, Luke?

185
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:32,100
是啊
Yeah.

186
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:35,680
我记得有一天 那时候我还跟卢克差不多大
I remember one day, I was around Luke's age,

187
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:38,180
我不大高兴在我爸店里待着
and I wasn't all that happy to be at food town,

188
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,900
但我爸爸知道该怎么做
but my dad knew exactly what to do.

189
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:41,220
他去找宣传员
He gets on the P.A.

190
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:44,060
说 注意了 购物者
And he says, "Attention, shoppers,"

191
00:06:44,103 --> 00:06:45,915
然后他把麦克风给了我
and then he hands the mike to me.

192
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,240
我吃了一惊
I was like, "What?"

193
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:52,740
"红翼花生酱 1.69元两瓶"
"Red wing peanut butter -- $1.69 for two."

194
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,540
他在那次促销中损失了很多钱
He lost a lot of money on that sale,

195
00:06:57,540 --> 00:06:59,240
但那种激动的感觉我绝对不会忘记
but it's a rush I'll never forget.

196
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,960
就像是在潜水艇上一样 对吧
It's like being on a submarine, right?

197
00:07:03,820 --> 00:07:06,320
你们是汤姆·克兰西的粉丝吗
You guys, uh, fans of Tom Clancy?

198
00:07:08,796 --> 00:07:10,748
让卢克带你们参观完吧
You know what? Luke'll finish the tour.

199
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:11,520
是办公室的电话
It's the office.

200
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:13,720
-你手机都没响 -到你表现的时候了
- It's not ringing. - This is your moment.

201
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:15,060
喂
Hello?

202
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:17,140
跟我来吧
Follow me, I guess.

203
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:22,720
我们怎么上二楼
How did we get on the second floor?

204
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,100
很棒吧
Isn't it great?

205
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,360
有个觉察不到的斜坡
There's an imperceptible rise.

206
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,440
你们要么掉头
So you guys can either reverse course

207
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:30,620
要么轮流顺着滑竿滑下去
or take turns sliding down the fireman's pole.

208
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:31,770
卢克会演示的
Luke'll show you.

209
00:07:32,850 --> 00:07:34,000
等等
H-hang on.

210
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,520
因为你不让爸妈为你哭
But because you wouldn't let mom and dad cry over you,

211
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,860
他俩的情绪会憋在心里
that emotion is gonna build up

212
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,260
然后在我和卢克身上爆发
and explode all over Luke and me.

213
00:07:41,343 --> 00:07:43,620
抱歉 我只是等不及了
I'm sorry. I just couldn't want.

214
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:45,820
你知道我等今天等了多久吗
Do you know how long I've been dreaming about this day?

215
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,760
离开你家人的那天吗
Leaving your family?

216
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,180
别说得像是我侮辱人一样
Don't turn it into an insult.

217
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:50,260
我只是准备好了
I'm just really ready for this.

218
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:53,560
我身边终于都是聪明有求知欲的人了
I'm finally surrounded by smart, curious people.

219
00:07:53,780 --> 00:07:54,200
好吧
Okay.

220
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,720
我要走了
So, I'm gonna go.

221
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,380
你好 你肯定是艾丽克斯
Hi! You must be Alex.

222
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:58,906
我是你的室友梅西
I'm your roomie. I'm Maisie.

223
00:07:58,906 --> 00:08:01,260
我爸爸说那是棒极了的缩写 但其实不是
My dad says it's short for amazing, but it's not.

224
00:08:01,613 --> 00:08:03,533
-等等 我选了另一个 -室友 我知道
- Wait, I-I picked a different -- - Roommate, I know.

225
00:08:03,533 --> 00:08:05,180
她生病了 她恐慌症发作了
She got sick -- Well, she had a panic attack.

226
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:07,620
我同情她 我来大姨妈之前也会这样
I can sympathize. I usually get one right before my cycle.

227
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:10,000
总之 他们拒绝了她的签证 她还在挪威
Anyways, they denied her visa and she's still in Norway.

228
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,020
救命 出不去了[挪威]
"Help! There's norway out."

229
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:15,140
你多大了
How old are you?

230
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:18,080
我15岁了 但我看过4部R级电影了
I'm 15, but I've seen four R-rated movies already.

231
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,380
你来了我好激动
I'm so excited you're here.

232
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:20,500
我该把药放哪儿啊
Where should I put my medicines?

233
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,660
你可以走了 我没事了
Yeah, so you are good to go. I'm fine.

234
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:23,620
等下
Oh, not quite yet.

235
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:26,540
梅西 你会说他国语言吗
So, Maisie, do you speak any languages?

236
00:08:26,827 --> 00:08:31,708
西语 法语 俄语 德语 还有伍基语[星战]
Si, Oui, Da, Ja, and of course I also speak wookiee.

237
00:08:33,355 --> 00:08:35,310
这一定会很有趣
Ahh! That is gonna be so much fun!

238
00:08:36,078 --> 00:08:37,213
是啊
Yay!

239
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:40,940
他们才住了两天就用了十八条毛巾
They've been here 2 days and they've used 18 towels,

240
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,360
却完全没有碰过肥皂
yet the soap is untouched.

241
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,940
他们是像大象一样互相蹭干净吗
What are they -- sloughing each other clean like elephants?

242
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,700
米奇尔 太好了 你来了
Mitchell. Great, you're here.

243
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:48,760
查克教练家里有人去世了
Coach Chuck had a death in the family.

244
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:51,320
多谢你能记得介绍我生意
Thank you so much for remembering about the referrals.

245
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,920
我现在没带名片 但是...
I don't have a card on me right now, but --

246
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,800
不是 是他不能来
No. He can't come,

247
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,240
由于你是助理教练
and since you're the assistant coach,

248
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:56,920
现在由你带队
you're in charge.

249
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,000
好吧
Okay.

250
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:02,440
你应该没问题吧
Think you're gonna be okay with that?

251
00:09:02,660 --> 00:09:04,000
助理教练跟教练又有多大区别呢
Assistant coach, coach. What's the big diff?

252
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:07,300
从一名真正教练的角度看 确实不一样
Well, as an actual coach, um, diff.

253
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:09,260
拜托 今天就是来享受新鲜空气的
Come on, today's about being out in the fresh air,

254
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:10,820
抛开家里那些问题
forgetting about our problems at home,

255
00:09:10,900 --> 00:09:12,360
与家人共度这美好时光吧
spending some quality time with the family.

256
00:09:12,540 --> 00:09:13,420
说得对 说得对
You're right, you're right.

257
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:14,440
我的家人在哪里
Where is my family?

258
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,760
你觉得他们是不是想放我们鸽子
You don't think they're standing us up, do you?

259
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,220
我在超市见到杰的时候
You know, when I saw Jay at the grocery store

260
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:18,200
问他们会不会来
and asked him if they were coming,

261
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,720
他拿了一颗试吃的肉丸嚼了整整一分钟
he took a sample meatball and chewed it for a full minute

262
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,920
才说来 所以...
before he said yes, so...

263
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:27,020
你们都还在家啊
You all are still here.

264
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,440
你多常闯进来一次
How often do you break in here?

265
00:09:28,620 --> 00:09:29,980
所以白葡萄酒是你喝的吗
Does that explain the white wine?

266
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:31,400
我们为此炒了一名清洁工
We fired a cleaning lady.

267
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,580
我还以为你们已经
Listen, I thought you guys

268
00:09:32,580 --> 00:09:34,260
去看莉莉的足球赛了
would already be at Lily's soccer game,

269
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:36,240
今天早上我家情绪太哀伤
And things have been pretty emotional at my house this morning.

270
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:38,100
所以我只想在泳池边待上几个小时
I just wanted a couple hours by the pool.

271
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:41,120
肯定也是克莱尔把冰桶留在按摩浴池边的
Claire must have left the ice bucket by the jacuzzi, too.

272
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,520
我会给清洁工写一封信
I will write the cleaning lady a letter.

273
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:44,920
你怎么逃掉去看莉莉的比赛的呢
How'd you get out of Lily's game?

274
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:47,500
我撒谎说艾丽克斯今天离家去学校
I lied and said that Alex was leaving for school today,

275
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:49,960
结果成真了 所以没我事了
which turned out to be true, so I'm off the hook.

276
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,340
有精彩的地方回头告诉我
You guys let me know what I miss.

277
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,520
你能接电话吗
Could you get that?

278
00:09:54,276 --> 00:09:55,460
-喂 -克莱尔
- Yello? - Claire?

279
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:57,740
你在那里干什么 我们已经等了...
What are you doing there? We've been waiting --

280
00:09:57,740 --> 00:09:58,740
天啊 天啊 天啊
Oh, God, oh, God, oh, God.

281
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,760
-不敢相信 -真不敢相信
- I don't believe this. - I don't believe this.

282
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:02,740
居然还要毛巾 他们难道是产婆吗
They want more towels. What are they, midwives?

283
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:03,515
这边
Here.

284
00:10:04,740 --> 00:10:05,860
不要理会
Just ignore it.

285
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:12,220
他到底有多少部手机
How many phones does he have?

286
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:13,860
接电话 随便谁 我...
Pick up. Anybody. I --

287
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,000
我还可以要到更多电话
You know, I could get more phones.

288
00:10:17,317 --> 00:10:18,862
他是不会停的
He's never gonna stop.

289
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,340
米奇尔 你好 我没空说话
Mitchell, hi. Hey, can't talk.

290
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:23,140
我现在正跟艾丽克斯一起要去大学
I'm just leaving my house right now with alex.

291
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,680
我知道你在老爸家
I know you're at Dad's house.

292
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,140
好吧 听着
Yeah, okay. Um, look.

293
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:29,360
我什么都不想说 爸爸发生了点意外
I didn't want to say anything. Dad got in an accident.

294
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:30,680
他没事 不用担心
He's fine. Nothing to worry about,

295
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:32,231
不过我得走了 拜拜
but I got to go. Bye.

296
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,660
演技真烂
That was pathetic.

297
00:10:34,186 --> 00:10:35,942
我来给你们演示一下该怎么做
Let me show you how it's done.

298
00:10:37,340 --> 00:10:38,080
你好 米奇尔
Hello, Mitchell.

299
00:10:38,220 --> 00:10:40,460
听说我爸出了点小事故
So I hear my dad had a little accident?

300
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:44,260
是啊 当然了 你爸出的事故
Yes, of course, well, the accident that your father had

301
00:10:44,260 --> 00:10:47,600
其实就是他不小心往自己脚上
is that actually he shot himself

302
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,900
开了一枪
in the foot.

303
00:10:51,631 --> 00:10:53,880
相信我 他相信了
Trust me. He believed me.

304
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,960
你们还有听到电话响起的声音吗
You're not listening to any phone ringings right now,

305
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:56,520
没有吧
are you?

306
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:57,980
所以现在变成了
So, this is turning into

307
00:10:57,980 --> 00:10:59,980
泳池边的集体活动了吗
a whole group thing by the pool.

308
00:11:00,500 --> 00:11:01,240
我家的泳池
Our pool.

309
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,980
各位 我刚接到一条小卡的短信
You guys, I just got a text from Cam.

310
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:06,640
手机给我
Give me that.

311
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:09,480
"天啊 人家当然希望杰没有事
"Gosh, I sure do hope Jay's all right.

312
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,720
发生这种事情真是好难以置信啊"
It's unbelievable something like that could have happened."

313
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:12,600
不用谢
You're welcome.

314
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:13,560
太棒了
Fantastic.

315
00:11:13,707 --> 00:11:15,240
-完美 -我们都解脱了
- It's perfect. - We're all good.

316
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:17,060
各位 你们最好再听一遍
Well, you guys, you might want to listen again,

317
00:11:17,060 --> 00:11:18,320
不过这次我来演小卡
only this time, I'll be Cam.

318
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:22,000
"天呐 人家当然希望杰没有事
"Gosh, I sure do hope jay is all right."

319
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,380
发生这种事情真是好"难以置信"啊"
It's unbelievable something like this could happen."

320
00:11:25,893 --> 00:11:27,488
我们惨了
We're screwed.

321
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:29,620
好 他们现在要过来了
Okay, they're coming,

322
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:31,300
你敢相信他们居然想跳票吗
but can you believe they were gonna bail?

323
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:34,020
眼睛看脚下 看脚下
Keep your -- keep your eyes down. Eyes down.

324
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:35,700
我们有错过一次他们小孩的活动吗
Have we missed a single one of their kids' events?

325
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:38,280
我们又不是每天闲着没事干
And it's not like we don't have a million things going on right now.

326
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,240
跟上去
Follow through!

327
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:40,660
对啊 比如上次我们被迫看完
Yeah, like when we had to sit through that

328
00:11:40,660 --> 00:11:42,380
五年级生演的干净版《吉屋出租》
sanitized fifth-grade production of "rent"

329
00:11:42,380 --> 00:11:44,100
他们都得了感冒的那个
where they all got head colds?

330
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:46,820
腿伸直 给我把腿伸直
Keep your leg straight. Keep your leg straight for me.

331
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:47,960
-小卡 你能不这样吗 -什么
- Cam, can you not do that? - What?

332
00:11:48,380 --> 00:11:50,840
那个 貌似教练是我 所以...
Well, it's just that, you know, I'm kind of coach, so --

333
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,360
你什么时候不帮我 这种时候帮
It just seems weird that this is the time

334
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,580
感觉有点奇怪
that you're trying to help me.

335
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,300
好吧 我怎么不帮你了
Okay, and in what way am I not helpful?

336
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:58,280
比如我之前在见一名刚丧偶的客户时
Okay, well, when I'm with a bereaved client, say,

337
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,080
你却觉得那种时刻很适合
and you decide that that's the perfect moment

338
00:12:00,090 --> 00:12:02,460
用你吓死人的演技演一段死去的戏码
for a scenery-chewing death scene.

339
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:04,480
完全比不上你在处理"艺术房客"相关事宜时
Unlike the tremendous help you've been to me

340
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,420
帮我的大忙啊
running the artful lodger.

341
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:07,180
你连域名都没注册上
You couldn't even register the domain name.

342
00:12:07,220 --> 00:12:08,260
反正我也不喜欢那个名字
I never liked that name, anyways.

343
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,360
你终于说出来了
And there it is.

344
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,720
我明白了
I see what this is.

345
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,960
-什么 -嫉妒
- What? - Jealousy.

346
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,680
就是啊
Yeah! Yeah.

347
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:15,126
因为你带的足球队看起来赢不了
'cause your football team can't seem to win,

348
00:12:15,126 --> 00:12:17,039
而我已经四比零了
but here I am 4-0.

349
00:12:17,242 --> 00:12:18,300
好吧 够了
Okay, please. Yeah.

350
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:20,300
这不过是小女孩玩玩足球
This is little girls' soccer.

351
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:22,140
都不能算真的运动
It's not even a real sport.

352
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,280
抱歉
Excuse me?

353
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:28,340
恐怕我必须请您离开了
I'm afraid I'm gonna have to ask you to leave.

354
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,580
不 我只是...
Oh, no, I was just --

355
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:31,360
别敬酒不吃吃罚酒
Let's not do this the hard way.

356
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,100
真是太糟糕了
It's the worst of everything.

357
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,460
我们得去看那白痴比赛
We have to go to the damn game.

358
00:12:37,064 --> 00:12:39,320
而且以后他们不可能再相信我们的借口
And they're never gonna believe any of our excuses

359
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:41,220
哪怕是真的 他们也不会相信了
in the future, even if they're real.

360
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:45,240
除非...
Unless...

361
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:46,280
你为什么要这样
Why do you do that?

362
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:48,580
为什么说完"除非"就不说了
Why do you say "unless" and then pause?

363
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,600
把想法说完整好吗
Just finish the thought.

364
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:52,360
除非杰真的被枪打中脚了
Unless Jay really gets shot in the foot.

365
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:55,080
真不敢相信我又得说一遍
I can't believe I'm saying this, once again,

366
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,960
尽管我们结婚才七年
in only seven years of marriage,

367
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:58,700
但真心求你把枪放下
but please put the gun down.

368
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,760
别这么孬
Don't be a baby.

369
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,460
这只是一把弹子枪
It's a pellet gun.

370
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:04,460
最多擦伤留个痕
It's just going to be a little nick on the side,

371
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:06,600
然后我们就可以去看比赛了
and then we go to the game.

372
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,177
他们就会看见你是真的受了伤
They're gonna see that it's true.

373
00:13:08,177 --> 00:13:11,520
他们会因为没有相信我们而感到惭愧
They're gonna feel horrible because they didn't believe us,

374
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:14,320
然后我们就一整年啥活动都不用去了
and then we don't have to go to anything for a whole year.

375
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,020
不得不说 这有点道理
I have to say, it makes sense.

376
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:17,480
没有道理
No, it doesn't!

377
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:21,120
我干嘛不直接贴个绷带一瘸一拐出场呢
Why don't I just bandage my foot up and limp on in there?

378
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,020
不行 不行
No, no, no, no, no.

379
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:25,660
必须得来真的 不然被他们发现的话
It has to be real because if they catch us faking it,

380
00:13:25,660 --> 00:13:26,940
更难收场
it's going to be worse.

381
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:28,200
请别拿枪指着我
Please don't point the gun at me.

382
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:29,720
好了 行了 我爸也说了
Okay, all right, all right. You heard my dad.

383
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:30,320
把枪挪开
Put the gun away.

384
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:33,520
我们得 得想想其他办法
We just -- we'll have to think of something else.

385
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:34,320
该怎么办呢
What to do?

386
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:36,480
快 开 枪
Shoot, shoot, shoot.

387
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:37,580
好吧我把枪拿开
Okay, I'll put the gun away.

388
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:39,580
天哪
No!

389
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:42,160
我去 你是故意的
No! You did that on purpose!

390
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,280
我都没看着你
I wasn't even looking!

391
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,560
我都转过身了 真对不起
I turned my back on you. I'm so sorry!

392
00:13:47,140 --> 00:13:48,500
看好那个杯子
Watch the sippy cup.

393
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,580
希望你喜欢重金属摇滚乐
I hope you're a heavy metal fan

394
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:00,580
因为整个"金属"周期表
because all the heavy metals

395
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:02,000
要挂到你奖杯头顶上了
are going right here above your trophy.

396
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,140
酷 梅西
Cool. Maisie.

397
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:07,040
话说楼下好像在发邮箱的钥匙
So, I heard they're giving out mailbox keys downstairs,

398
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:09,680
可以麻烦你去把我们俩的钥匙都领回来吗
and I was thinking maybe you could pick up both of ours?

399
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:11,120
当然没问题 朋友
Sure thing, friend!

400
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:13,440
多好的一天 我有了邮箱还有了朋友
What a day -- I've got a mailbox and a friend!

401
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,540
你必须有
You sure do.

402
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:16,860
你能尽量别这么幸灾乐祸了吗
Could you try not to enjoy this so much?

403
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:18,200
我这已经是努力忍住了
This is me trying.

404
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,980
这一切到此结束了
This ends now.

405
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:20,780
你要干嘛
What are you doing?

406
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:23,160
你觉得我要干嘛 我要摆脱她
What do you think I'm doing? I'm getting rid of her.

407
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,820
我要打给我的导师申请换个室友
I'm calling my advisor and getting a new roommate.

408
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:28,720
-不行 -把手机还给我
- No. - Give that back.

409
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:30,600
需要提醒你我是黄带吗
Need I remind you I am a yellow belt?

410
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:32,960
虽然我记不住你那堆丑腰带
I can't keep track of all your ugly belts,

411
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:34,880
但我就是觉得你不该换室友
but I don't think you should change roommates.

412
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:38,060
听着 尽管你是我上大学的核心军师
Listen, as much as you're my go-to girl on college advice,

413
00:14:38,060 --> 00:14:39,460
-可我... -天啊
- I really -- - Oh, my God.

414
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:41,080
你能先闭嘴一会吗
Would you just shut up for a second?

415
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,980
是这样的
Here's the thing --

416
00:14:43,140 --> 00:14:45,320
我也有过这么一个室友
I had a similar experience with a roommate.

417
00:14:45,331 --> 00:14:47,900
她是个讨人厌的"百事通"
She was this annoying little know-it-all

418
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:49,240
老把我惹毛
who totally got on my nerves.

419
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,800
-是 我知道 -别说话
- Yeah, I get it. - Oh, shh!

420
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:54,700
我也花了很长时间想要摆脱她
I spent a long time trying to get rid of her

421
00:14:55,002 --> 00:14:56,520
可是直到我发现这个小姑娘
until I realized that that little girl,

422
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:59,400
其实一直默默地在崇拜着我
in her own way, put me on a pedestal.

423
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,360
我很开心
It felt great.

424
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:06,200
你刚刚来到一个到处是牛逼人物的地方
You just landed in a world of superstars,

425
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:08,720
我也不知道你永远不会承认
and I know you'd never admit it,

426
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:11,520
但你其实还是很害怕的
but you're scared.

427
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:15,720
拥有一个你自己的拉拉队长并不是坏事
It's not the worst thing to have your own personal cheerleader.

428
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:19,780
我也开始想念我的拉拉队长了
I miss mine already.

429
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:29,180
我的五秒应该到了
Well, I guess my five seconds is up.

430
00:15:34,585 --> 00:15:36,650
这么小的浴室虽然不常见
You don't often see a 5/8 bathroom,

431
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:38,220
但他们也是妥善考量后设计的
but they're highly sought after.

432
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,560
这笔生意已经十拿九稳了 孩子
The deal's in the bag, kid.

433
00:15:40,580 --> 00:15:42,020
我再收收尾 然后我们就走人
I'm just gonna wrap it up, and then we bounce.

434
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:43,520
我们就蹦起来[走人]
And then we bounce.

435
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:45,320
去蹦床公园啊
Trampoline park.

436
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:47,168
你怎么不跟我弹跳式击掌了
How are you not high-boinging me right now?

437
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:49,160
我想去码头
I was thinking of maybe

438
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:50,720
和我的小伙伴们碰面
meeting up with my crew at the pier.

439
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,960
没问题 我们蹦完蹦床你再去
Sure thing. After we tramp.

440
00:15:53,560 --> 00:15:53,920
好吧
Fine.

441
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,180
很快 我不再跟爸爸去商店玩了
After a while, I stopped hanging out with my dad at the store.

442
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:58,520
我开始忙拉拉队的训练
I got busy with cheer practice,

443
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:01,680
也开始觉得橙子堆的金字塔不再酷炫
and I guess pyramids of oranges don't seem so great

444
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:03,480
因为我已经叠过人体金字塔了
after you've built pyramids out of man.

445
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,400
我不知道爸爸会不会因我少回家而难过
I don't know if it bothered him that I stopped coming around,

446
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:11,060
但即使他真的难过 他也从未表露
but if it did, he never let it show.

447
00:16:13,420 --> 00:16:15,140
好了 咱们出发吧
All right. Let's do this.

448
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:18,281
其实我觉得我
Actually, I think I, uh --

449
00:16:18,281 --> 00:16:19,000
我好像扭到了脚踝
I twisted my ankle

450
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,040
刚才从满是折叠床的房间蹦出来时扭了
jumping out of the way in that room full of murphy beds.

451
00:16:21,260 --> 00:16:22,800
我最好还是别上蹦床了
I probably shouldn't get on a trampoline.

452
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:24,680
你还是去跟你朋友一起玩吧
You should go hang out with your friends.

453
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:26,280
-真的吗 -是的
- Really? - Yeah.

454
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:28,000
想快点去的话 最好是得他们来接你
Might be faster if they come get you, though.

455
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,300
我还得再打扫一遍这房子
I should do one more sweep of the house.

456
00:16:29,471 --> 00:16:31,299
我觉得跟布兰斯顿这家人的生意吹了
I think I lost the Blanstons.

457
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:33,680
谢谢你 爸爸
Thanks, dad.

458
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:35,800
债贱
Deuces.

459
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:40,920
加油 姑娘们
Let's go, girls!

460
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,140
传球 动起来
Pass and move!

461
00:16:43,812 --> 00:16:46,083
运动员不要一直傻站着
The players should never be standing still!

462
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,140
最好的防守就是有力的进攻
The best defense is good offense.

463
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,100
这不对
Well, now, that can't be true.

464
00:16:51,170 --> 00:16:52,504
中场休息
Halftime!

465
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:54,160
好吧 上半场很棒
Okay, good -- good half!

466
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,320
好 我们落后三分 但是没关系
All right, we're down by three, but that's okay.

467
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,640
看啊 看看是谁终于出现了
Look. Look who finally showed up.

468
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:01,260
太不容易了
Not easily.

469
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:04,000
你们也看得到 我的脚伤得很重
As you can see, I have a severely injured foot.

470
00:17:04,011 --> 00:17:05,222
小卡在哪儿
Where is Cam?

471
00:17:05,332 --> 00:17:07,962
他 他被裁判罚出场了
He -- he got banished by the ref.

472
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:10,440
怎么会这样 说具体点
How did that happen? Be specific.

473
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:11,240
这有什么
Who cares?

474
00:17:11,630 --> 00:17:14,867
重要的是我实打实地被枪打中了--
The important thing is I did, in fact, shoot myself in the --

475
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,640
省省吧 假伤就够了 别再伤脸皮了
Save it. Don't add insult to fake injury.

476
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:17,460
-我假伤 -是的
- Fake. - Yeah.

477
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:18,280
没搞错吧
Seriously?

478
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:22,800
看看他的小脚趾
Say hello to his little toe.

479
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:24,880
天哪 你居然真的
Oh, my God. You really

480
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:25,980
打中了自己的脚
shot myself in the foot.

481
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,620
是啊 是挺吓人的
Yeah, it was so scary.

482
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:30,400
-还流了好多血 -场面血流成河
- And the blood. - There was so much blood.

483
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:32,420
可是你们还是来了
But you guys -- you still showed up anyway.

484
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:34,210
-当然要来了 -一定会来的
- Of course! - Without a doubt.

485
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,620
是妈妈开枪打的杰
Mommy shot Jay.

486
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:37,123
什么 你不是说是自己打中的吗
I'm sorry, what? I thought you said --

487
00:17:37,123 --> 00:17:41,223
是妈妈打中的杰 克莱尔阿姨说 "打他"
Yeah, mommy shot Jay. Aunt Claire said, "Shoot him."

488
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:42,140
爸
Dad.

489
00:17:42,820 --> 00:17:45,640
你宁愿中一枪也不想来支持你的孙女吗
You would rather take a bullet than support your granddaughter?

490
00:17:45,740 --> 00:17:47,140
这都是歌洛莉亚的主意
This was really Gloria's idea.

491
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:49,080
我身边全都是泄密者
I'm surrounded by rats.

492
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:49,920
米奇尔 听我说
Mitchell, listen to me.

493
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:52,340
我知道"对不起"一点诚意也没有
I know "I'm sorry" barely covers it,

494
00:17:52,340 --> 00:17:54,740
但是让我来这里看这些小女孩踢球
but it's very difficult for me to come here today

495
00:17:54,740 --> 00:17:56,360
真的太折磨人了
and watch little girls playing soccer

496
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:59,120
因为我自己的女儿今天离开我去上大学了
on the same day that my little girl left for college.

497
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,260
我也是
Well, me too.

498
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:02,720
我要看着我的孙女离开
I mean, watching my little grandbaby go off --

499
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,580
别来跟风我的理由
Don't jump on my thing.

500
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:04,960
抱歉打扰你们
Sorry to interrupt.

501
00:18:05,380 --> 00:18:07,160
其他的父母还有保姆投票了
So, the parents and nannies voted,

502
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:09,060
我们决定解除你的职务
and we're going to relieve you of your command.

503
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,740
可是我是教练啊
but I'm the coach, so --

504
00:18:10,749 --> 00:18:11,926
现在我才是教练
I'm the coach now.

505
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:15,920
我真高兴你们能赶上这个场面
Glad you got here in time to see that.

506
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,680
一点也不好笑 克莱尔
It's not funny, Claire.

507
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:22,160
小卡 你在哪
Cam. Where are you?

508
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,920
我站在停车场 戴着双目镜
In the parking lot with binoculars.

509
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:24,852
等等
What, when did --

510
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:26,580
你什么时候买了件军装风外套
When did you buy an army jacket?

511
00:18:26,820 --> 00:18:28,160
不是那个 左边的才是我
Not him, to the left.

512
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:29,800
看见你了
Oh, hi.

513
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,600
你居然让黛比抢走了你的哨子
So you let Debbie take your whistle?

514
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:33,960
是啊 也不能怪她 我水平太差
Well, yeah, I can't blame her. I'm a terrible coach.

515
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:36,400
抱歉我对你这么差
I mean, I'm sorry I-I pushed you away.

516
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,740
别乱说
No, no, no. You hush up.

517
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:38,920
我才是该道歉的那个
I'm the one who's sorry.

518
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,840
你知道吗 我一直想假装
You know what? I've been trying to pretend like

519
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,460
生活压力没有影响到我 其实我很受影响
the pressure hasn't gotten to me, but it has.

520
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:43,700
谢天谢地 我也是
Oh, my God. Me too.

521
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:45,420
我一直以为我们会是那种
I, I always thought we were that couple

522
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:47,320
患难之中见真情的伴侣 你懂吗
that could rise above tough times, you know?

523
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:50,051
我不想让我们之间有距离
I just -- I don't want to feel like there's distance between us.

524
00:18:50,051 --> 00:18:51,320
你说什么了 再说一遍
What? Sorry, you're -- say that again.

525
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:52,340
-你那边信号断了 -我听不见
- You're breaking up. - I didn't hear you.

526
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:54,386
-什么 -我听见了
-what? Huh? -what? T-there you are.

527
00:18:54,620 --> 00:18:55,700
下半场开始了
Second half, girls.

528
00:18:55,700 --> 00:18:58,160
中场休息结束了 我得走了
Oh, God. Okay. Intermission's over. I got to --

529
00:18:58,160 --> 00:19:00,140
听着 你要把你的指挥权抢回来
Okay, listen up, Bub. You go get your team back.

530
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,640
我们需要这个 今天你得让我们赢
We need this. You're gonna get us a win today.

531
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:03,100
怎么赢
How?

532
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,560
先去把哨子抢回来
Just go get your whistle back.

533
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:05,180
看着我
Look at me.

534
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,040
我们能做到
We got this.

535
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:09,021
-我们落后三球 不过 -你们好啊
- Okay, so we're down by three, but—- - hi!

536
00:19:09,996 --> 00:19:11,680
接下来就交给我吧
So, I got this from here, so --

537
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,560
你在干什么
What do you think you're doing?

538
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:13,760
完成我的使命
What I was born to do.

539
00:19:13,980 --> 00:19:15,200
靠 我才是教练
I am a coach, damn it.

540
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:16,980
天哪 抱歉
God. I'm so sorry.

541
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:20,000
看你扯我的时候 还以为很容易
That came off so much easier when you did it.

542
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:22,580
变装舞会的经验告诉我们
As our history with costume parties has taught us --

543
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:24,940
夫夫出击 天下无敌
we shine brightest when we work as a team.

544
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:26,240
没错
Yeah.

545
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:28,800
让前锋组成三角形 拉开防线
Okay, have the forwards form a triangle, spread the defense.

546
00:19:28,940 --> 00:19:30,540
前锋上前组成三角形
Okay, forwards, form a triangle.

547
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:31,380
拉开防线
Spread the defense.

548
00:19:31,800 --> 00:19:33,940
下半场快结束时 我们追平了比分
By late in the half, we had tied the score.

549
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:36,000
这又一次证明 最好的进攻就是防守
Proving once again, the best offense is a good defense.

550
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:38,540
这句话就像在说最好的帽子就是鞋子一样
That's like saying the best hat is a shoe.

551
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:41,760
还剩十秒钟的时候 莉莉迎来了她的机会
Okay, with 10 seconds left, Lily was open on the wing.

552
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,120
让她把球传给莉莉
Now have her pass to Lily.

553
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,240
传球给莉莉
Pass to Lily!

554
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:45,820
-她传给了莉莉 -我看见了
- She passed to Lily. - I can see.

555
00:19:47,303 --> 00:19:49,855
什么 太棒了
What?! Yes! Yes! Yes!

556
00:19:51,380 --> 00:19:53,200
这都是我的功劳
That was me. I did that.

557
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:56,600
没错 就是他教的
That was him! He did that.

558
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:05,020
她不在家这感觉确实有些不同
It does feel different without her here.

559
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:05,440
没错
Yep.

560
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:08,660
卢克不在家感觉好安静
Pretty quiet without Luke here, too.

561
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:10,640
他有说什么时候回来吗
Did he say what time he's coming home?

562
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:13,220
很快就回来了吧 他给你留了样东西
Soon, I'm sure. Oh, he left you something.

563
00:20:16,740 --> 00:20:19,500
"谢谢你今天带我去看那疯狂的房子
"Thanks for letting me see that crazy house today.

564
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:21,780
明天想跟我一起建个房子吗"
Feel like building one ourselves tomorrow?"

565
00:20:23,460 --> 00:20:23,900
天哪
What?

566
00:20:24,951 --> 00:20:26,969
他回去把鸭蛋都捡起来了
He went back for the duck eggs.

567
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:29,980
我们今天在那房子前找到了这些蛋
We found these eggs out in front of the house.

568
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:31,520
是的 我猜到了
Yeah, honey. I-I-I got it. I got it.

569
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,540
你们俩我最清楚不过了
I know the two of you well enough.

570
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:33,560
我可以猜到来龙去脉
I can connect the dots.

571
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:35,360
不过你真的帮了我大忙
But you just really helped me out.

572
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,500
你在打给谁
Who are you --

573
00:20:37,580 --> 00:20:38,480
妈 你怎么又打来了
Again, mom?

574
00:20:39,060 --> 00:20:40,560
艾丽克斯 我知道你说过
Alex, I know you said not to call

575
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:43,120
没有大事别打给你 但这事很重要
unless it was very important, but this is.

576
00:20:43,120 --> 00:20:46,220
我要知道跟小鸭子有关的一切知识
I need to know everything you can tell me about baby ducks.

577
00:20:55,323 --> 00:20:57,220
痛死了
It stings!

578
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,760
这一点也不性感
This is so not sexy.

579
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
现在大家都赞同这个主意了吧
Okay, so we all agree.

580
00:21:01,460 --> 00:21:04,240
每人每年可以缺席一次家中子女的活动
Everybody gets a free pass once a year to miss a kid event.

581
00:21:04,420 --> 00:21:06,080
我听说卢克要组建一个乐队
Ooh, I heard Luke might be forming a boy band,

582
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:07,200
我想用掉我的那次机会
so I want to get out in front of that.

583
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,060
太好了 这样你就得来参加
Great! That means you'll be available

584
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:10,810
我一人分饰多角版本的新剧
for my one-man quick-change version

585
00:21:10,820 --> 00:21:12,300
《七对佳偶》
of "Seven brides for seven brothers."

586
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:13,620
我还是换成缺席这个吧
I'm gonna change my vote.

587
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:14,700
我选择不要参加这个
Yeah, put me down for missing that, too.

588
00:21:14,700 --> 00:21:15,780
可是你们都没明白呢
No, but you don't understand.

589
00:21:15,780 --> 00:21:17,690
里面所有的角色都是我演的
I-I play all the brides and all the brothers.

590
00:21:17,700 --> 00:21:18,240
我也不去
Make it three.

591
00:21:19,110 --> 00:21:20,390
杰 你一定会来的 对吧
But you'll come, right, Jay?
